{"extract": "Oluwadamilare Babatunde Art Alade (born 9 February 1982), known professionally as Darey, formerly Dare Art Alade, is a Nigerian multi-platinum Afro R&B singer, songwriter, record producer, philanthropist, humanitarian and entrepreneur. He is also the son of the African jazz musician and entertainer Art Alade and the creative director of Livespot360.", "links": [{"ns": 0, "title": "Afrobeats", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Art Alade", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Deola Art Alade", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Lagos", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Lagos State", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Livespot360", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Nigeria", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Premium Times", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "R&B", "exists": true}, {"ns": 0, "title": "Singing", "exists": true}, {"ns": 1, "title": "Talk:Darey", "exists": true}, {"ns": 4, "title": "Wikipedia:About you", "exists": true}, {"ns": 4, "title": "Wikipedia:Biographies of living persons", "exists": true}, {"ns": 4, "title": "Wikipedia:Citing sources", "exists": true}, {"ns": 4, "title": "Wikipedia:Conflict of interest", "exists": true}, {"ns": 4, "title": "Wikipedia:Libel", "exists": true}, {"ns": 4, "title": "Wikipedia:Neutral point of view", "exists": true}, {"ns": 4, "title": "Wikipedia:Reliable sources", "exists": true}, {"ns": 4, "title": "Wikipedia:Scam warning", "exists": true}, {"ns": 4, "title": "Wikipedia:Verifiability", "exists": true}, {"ns": 12, "title": "Help:Maintenance template removal", "exists": true}]}